        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage J-DOV, Dexter Series Dover Door Lever Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSimple yet modern in design, the Schlage Dover Lever is a great way to update your door hardware without breaking your bank. Schlage makes installing this lever easy. On doors with standard cut-outs, the universal latch fits either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and it will fit doors with thicknesses from 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\". Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. This leverset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and the 5 year finish warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Dexter Dover Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2, 1996, Series 4000 Grade 3.</li>\r\n<li>Exposed trim is made out of wrought brass or bronze. Levers are zinc-based.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>5-Pin tumbler standard Schlage C keyway (for Keyed Entry function) .</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n<li>5 year finish warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage Dover Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\".</li>\r\n<li>Universal latch fits either 2-3/8\"or 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim. Does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. A turn-button located in the middle of the lever locks the door while turning the inside lever unlocks it.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button. Inside locked and unlocked by turn-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Dover Door Leverset, Schlage J-DOV",
                "description": "Schlage J-DOV Dexter Dover Leverset - Simple yet modern in design, the SchlageDover Lever is a great way to update your door hardware without breaking your bank. Schlage makes installing this lever easy. On doors with standard cut-outs, the universal latch fits either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and it will fit doors with thicknesses from 1-3/8 inch up to 1-3/4 inch. Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. This leverset has a lifetime mechanical warranty and the 5 year finish warranty.",
